Picking up an Orb of Power refreshes Ceremony from the 2-piece set bonus to 30 seconds.

Scoring 2 Ability Kills during Ceremony spawns a Loyal <arc Arc /> Moth that lasts for 8 seconds. Moths relentlessly chase the closest enemy within 60+ meters, dealing up to <pve 180 /> <pvp [?] /> <arc Arc /> damage and <arc Blinding /> enemies for 8 seconds in an approximately 6? meter radius.

Anything that would discharge <arc Bolt Charge /> counts toward the kill requirement, including Unpowered Melees and <yellow Forerunner />'s Rock. Praxic Blade is excluded.

Moths deal generic <arc Arc /> damage. They do not benefit from or interact with Grenade, Melee, or Ability buffs.

// The source gives pursuit range as 60+ meters and blast radius as approximately 6? meters. PvP damage is not provided.
// The source calls the trigger Ability Kills but broadens it to anything that would discharge Bolt Charge. The draft preserves this criterion without inventing further qualifying sources.
